#: rust/src/settings.rs:666
msgid ""
"固定图标复用首个窗口，其他窗口独立显示。\n"
"长度随内容和面板空间自动调整，空间不足时显示更多菜单。\n"
"拖入 .desktop 文件或选择应用即可固定。\n"
"图标和预览共用中键设置。\n"
"喇叭滚轮调整应用音量，最高 200%。\n"
"预览画面仅保存在内存中。"
msgstr ""
"The first window reuses its pinned icon; other windows stay separate.\n"
"The icon area adapts to its contents and panel space, with an overflow menu "
"when needed.\n"
"Drop a .desktop file or choose an application to pin it.\n"
"Icons and previews share the middle-click setting.\n"
"Scroll over a speaker to adjust app volume, up to 200%.\n"
"Preview frames stay in memory."

